Below is a “road‑map” showing  

1. which columns in the three tables are needed and why, and  
2. ten exploratory‑to‑final SQL statements (each annotated) that gradually build the answer.

Relevant columns and their purpose
• `condition.plot_sequence_number` – join key to population.  
• `condition.inventory_year` – analysis year (2015–2017).  
• `condition.state_code`, `condition.state_code_name` – identify state.  
